# This file ensures the main LiteLLM infrastructure module directory is tracked in git
# The main module provisions complete LiteLLM infrastructure using the official BerriAI/litellm/aws module:
# - VPC with public/private subnets
# - ECS Fargate cluster and services (Gateway, Backend, UI)
# - Aurora PostgreSQL database
# - ElastiCache Redis
# - Application Load Balancer with HTTPS
# - Secrets Manager integration
# - CloudWatch monitoring and alarms
